    question: "Are you a Japanese web development company?",
    answer: "No. BtechWaleTech is a small team of engineers based in India, and we work with businesses in Japan remotely. We do not have an office in Japan, a Japanese kabushiki kaisha or godo kaisha, local staff or a Japanese address, and we will not pretend otherwise. What you get is direct access to the three engineers who build your project, working hours that cover the Japanese afternoon, and starting prices far below typical Japanese agency rates.",
