  {
    id: "services-detail",
    heading: "Our services for businesses in Japan, in detail",
    paragraphs: [
      `<strong>Web development.</strong> Corporate websites, recruitment sites, landing pages and content sites built on modern frameworks such as Astro, Next.js and React, or on WordPress, which is the most widely used CMS in Japan, when your team wants to edit pages without a developer. For most service businesses we recommend a static site: it loads quickly on phones, costs little to host and has very little to hack. The static plan covers up to 100 pages, responsive layouts, enquiry forms routed to email and chat, and deployment. Details are on the <a href="/services/web-development/">web development service page</a>.`,
      `<strong>Website design.</strong> Japanese websites have their own conventions. B2B buyers expect a company profile page (${ja("会社概要")}) with capital, founding date, representative and address, a message from the president (${ja("代表挨拶")}), a company history, access directions from the nearest station and dated news posts. Consumer sites are often denser with information than Western sites, with banners, prices and campaign details visible at once. We agree the page structure first, design the phone layout before the desktop one, and balance that expected density with fast loading and clear hierarchy.`,
      `<strong>Recruitment sites.</strong> With a shrinking working-age population, hiring is one of the biggest problems for Japanese companies, and a dedicated recruitment site (${ja("採用サイト")}) is often worth more than a redesign of the corporate site. We build job listings, staff interviews, workplace photos, application forms and job posting structured data so openings can appear in Google's job search features.`,
      "<strong>Ecommerce.</strong> Stores on Shopify, WooCommerce or a custom stack with cards including JCB, konbini payment, bank transfer, PayPay and deferred payment, delivery date and time-slot selection, gift wrapping and tax-inclusive prices. The ecommerce section below covers payments, marketplaces and logistics in detail.",
      `<strong>SEO.</strong> Search engine optimisation for Google and Yahoo! JAPAN: technical health, on-page work, content structure and local search. For B2B firms we build service and industry pages that answer procurement questions; for consumer businesses we focus on area and category searches. Our general approach is on the <a href="/services/seo-services/">SEO services page</a>.`,
      `<strong>Apps.</strong> iPhone has a larger share of the smartphone market in Japan than in most countries, so apps must feel right on iOS first while still working well on Android. We build one Flutter or React Native app for both, from ${both("Android")}, and publish it to the App Store and Google Play. More detail is on the <a href="/it-services/android-ios-app/">Android and iOS app page</a>.`,
      "<strong>Custom software and web apps.</strong> Booking and scheduling systems, member portals, quotation tools, inventory dashboards and admin panels. Many Japanese SMEs run on Excel files and kintone apps that worked well until the business grew; we build focused systems that replace the fragile parts and keep what works. Many requests for a mobile app are better served by a progressive web app that installs from the browser and updates without app store review.",
      "<strong>AI automation.</strong> Automations that remove repetitive admin: enquiries flowing into kintone or a CRM, LINE confirmations for bookings, invoices moving into freee or Money Forward, and AI-OCR that turns FAX and PDF orders into structured data. We map the current process before automating it, because automating a confused process just makes the confusion faster.",
      `<strong>Maintenance.</strong> After hosting goes live you get five months of maintenance included: content and price updates, bug fixes, security and dependency updates, backups, and uptime and speed checks. After that, maintenance continues from ${both("Maintenance")}, or you contact us only when something needs changing.`,
    ],
  },
